{"id":"d233854f6f1f60a3","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-cor-ran-topology.md","title":"RAN Topology","display":"cor-ran-topology — RAN Topology","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-ran-topology","aliases":["58-cor-ran-topology"],"display":"cor-ran-topology — RAN Topology","depends_on":["[[58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","[[58-df-reals]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-ran-topology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-ran-topology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-ran-topology — RAN Topology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"58-df-reals\">58-df-reals</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb{R}\\mid\\exists p\\in\\mathbb{Z}[t]\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(p(x)=0)\\}\">\\(A\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb{R}\\mid\\exists p\\in\\mathbb{Z}[t]\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(p(x)=0)\\}\\)</span>（实代数数集，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"58-df-reals\">58-df-reals</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R)\\)</span>（实数通常拓扑，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_A\\coloneqq\\{A\\cap U\\mid U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\}\">\\(\\tau_A\\coloneqq\\{A\\cap U\\mid U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\}\\)</span>（子空间拓扑）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\)</span>（紧致性谓词，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ran-topology} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\to\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_A,A)\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{Compact}_S(A,\\tau_A)\\land\n\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau_A\\;\n\\left(\nx\\in U\\to\n\\exists C\\subseteq A\\;\n\\bigl(x\\in C\\subseteq U\\land C\\in\\tau_A\\land A\\setminus C\\in\\tau_A\\bigr)\n\\right)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ran-topology} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\to\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_A,A)\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{Compact}_S(A,\\tau_A)\\land\n\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau_A\\;\n\\left(\nx\\in U\\to\n\\exists C\\subseteq A\\;\n\\bigl(x\\in C\\subseteq U\\land C\\in\\tau_A\\land A\\setminus C\\in\\tau_A\\bigr)\n\\right)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Real algebraic numbers have the topology induced from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}\">\\(\\mathbb{R}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>With the subspace topology, the real algebraic numbers are countable, dense-in-themselves, zero-dimensional, and noncompact; they are homeomorphic to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Q}\">\\(\\mathbb{Q}\\)</span>, not to the Cantor set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-reals","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-reals]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-reals","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb{R}\\mid\\exists p\\in\\mathbb{Z}[t]\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(p(x)=0)\\}$（实代数数集，see [[58-df-reals]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R)$（实数通常拓扑，see [[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}_S$（紧致性谓词，see [[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})$（see [[58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]）。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb{R}\\mid\\exists p\\in\\mathbb{Z}[t]\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(p(x)=0)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_A\\coloneqq\\{A\\cap U\\mid U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ran-topology} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\to\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_A,A)\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{Compact}_S(A,\\tau_A)\\land\n\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau_A\\;\n\\left(\nx\\in U\\to\n\\exists C\\subseteq A\\;\n\\bigl(x\\in C\\subseteq U\\land C\\in\\tau_A\\land A\\setminus C\\in\\tau_A\\bigr)\n\\right)\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Q}","display":false}],"bytes":1495,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-cor-ran-topology.md|58-cor-ran-topology]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["3b5b3d48ff1ff369","c54af6fc6a